// The truth of the fair set (S66) for Paul Puget, L'Heure tendre (Les frissons No.18, poem by Paul Gravollet):
// written from the Hamelle print (Paris 1905, J.5230 H., IMSLP #94633, data/fair/puget-heure/hamelle), bar by bar.
// Never to debug the reader on. Heads named by measuring them against their own staff lines (ruled.py, heads.py,
// col.py, zoomed). A run beamed from the right hand down into the left hand's staff is written in the staff its
// heads are printed in (as in the earlier truths); the left hand's whole-bar rest under it is kept as printed.
